# CHANGELOG.md — Template Definition

## Expression

- Short sentences, itemized
- Change facts only
- Version increment & sync

## Section Hierarchy

### H1 (required)
- Version & update record

### H2 (required)
- Version history: version / date / change items

### H3 (required)
- none

## Optional Sections

- [optional] Release notes: version / summary / tag
- [optional] Breaking changes: version / note
